gameplan
classes:
    enemy.Enemy: name, hp, level, damageRange, drops, dropRate
    enemy.NormalEnemy: enemy.Enemy...
    enemy.Boss: enemy.Enemy..., random prefix suffix??
    PlayerClass: action(ability), name, hp, resource, weapon, abilities, normalKills, bossKills, recoverHealth()
    Mage: PlayerClass..., abilities(fireball, frostArmor)
    Warrior: PlayerClass..., abilities(slash, fortify)
    Weapon: name, damageRange, type(melee, caster), statIncrease(+dmg/+resource)
    Armor: name, statIncrease(+hp/resource)
    Combat: action(choose ability), outcome, stage, normalFight(), bossFight()

    Main: 
        3 stages
        1. choose name, choose class
        2. next stage
        3. fight 3 normal enemies, get loot(25%), choose 1 or not
        4. fight boss, get loot(100%) pick weapon or armor
        5. next stage
        6. die, print stats